<title>USA: Emerson Electric votes stock split.</title>
<headline>Emerson Electric votes stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emerson Electric Co said Tuesday its board voted to split the company's stock two-for-one.  </p>
<p>Emerson plans to ask shareholders to approve an increase in the number of shares authorized to 1.2 billion from 400 million.</p>
<p>If shareholders approve the measure, the split will be effective March 10 for stockholders of record February 21.</p>
